OL,3,GNEWSAHome Guard training documents
OL,4,Adiscovered in attic
OL,5,
OL,6,FFound in his attic in Ruspidge, Bill
OL,7,FAcland said he does not know who the
OL,8,F"fascinating" papers, dating back to
OL,9,F1943, belonged to.
OL,11,FThe documents have now been added to a
OL,12,Fcollection of Home Guard artefacts at
OL,13,Fthe Dean Heritage Centre, which will go
OL,14,Fon display over remembrance.
